	<description><![CDATA[Standalone building loop, generated by scripts/gen_building_loop.py. Plan view 267 m -> spiral -> 1.2 turns -> eye level 34 m at radius 121 m. Altitudes derive from this building's extrusion height (24.5 m), so a corrected height re-cuts the shot. Load alongside geometry.kml.]]></description>
